{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Flesh and Fury</i> transports players to a brutal world set one million years BC, where a savage tyrant rules with an iron fist. In this ruthless era, the deranged warlord Don Hara orchestrates deadly gladiatorial battles between beautiful women, who must fight for the right to survive another day\u2014and for the twisted &quot;honor&quot; of sharing his bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464920/extras/4.png?t=1747195322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the top of this cruel hierarchy stands Vera, the arena's reigning champion. A fierce and unforgiving gladiator, she secretly defies Don Hara by having an illicit affair with his personal guard, Thal. Their betrayal adds another layer of tension and danger to the already deadly games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464920/extras/3.png?t=1747195322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist is a young girl from a nomadic desert tribe, orphaned when marauding raiders slaughter her family. Captured and sold into slavery, she finds herself thrust into the arena, fighting not just for her life but for her freedom. She is discovered by Thal, who sees potential in her, but there\u2019s one tragic catch\u2014she is mute, unable to speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464920/extras/1.png?t=1747195322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As we follow her harrowing journey, we witness her struggle to survive, enduring the hardships of the brutal arena while navigating the treacherous web of power and deceit surrounding her. Will the mute girl rise to become the arena's new champion, or will she fall victim to the bloodthirsty Vera?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464920/extras/2.png?t=1747195322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a tale of raw survival, betrayal, and forbidden desire, where every battle is a fight for life and every choice could mean death. The question is, will she conquer her silence and claim victory, or be consumed by the violence of the arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464920/extras/5.png?t=1747195322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explicit adult scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-quality illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters are 18+</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bite your tongue, rookie.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920/5ed9fe9c0e8fb2e49cd41baac83ea2360f8e5334.jpg"},{"name":"The key is to find a compromise.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920/971d7ce0394f55df837f985a9b5c165f5d5867a9.jpg"},{"name":"It's not shrunken, it's just the color.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920/061116551eceeecb65d34f55939321613a3ed165.jpg"},{"name":"The sacred rite has been interrupted!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920/ce48aca90ef10bf7307c879566b6b26807489496.jpg"},{"name":"The first part, endless battles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920/9e48199b47a3983a84cdb679ffefd27e00a1a738.jpg"},{"name":"Skill is in your boobs.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464920